This repository and the website it builds (https://layers.city) are the work of
Nouman Khan. That includes the source code, build and fetch scripts, GitHub
workflows, page designs, and the written and curated content: tour text,
descriptions of places, "known as" names, landmark and street lists, the rules
behind the "what stands out" facts, and the place pages.

